Third-party components
----------------------

The released model weights (artifacts/best_model_refit.pth) contain an image
trunk INITIALISED from torchvision's ImageNet-pretrained ResNet-18
(resnet18, IMAGENET1K_V1 weights) and then fine-tuned at a reduced
learning rate (README item 5), so its weights are derived from, but not
verbatim copies of, the torchvision parameters. The ImageNet input
normalisation is applied inside the model (the in_mean / in_std buffers of
the checkpoint), and the trunk's batch-norm running statistics are kept
frozen during training: they are torchvision's, up to the floating-point
rounding of the weight EMA (at most 2e-4 absolute; README items 5 and
7). The label trunk, the
fully connected layers and the raster head (README items 4 and 9) are
trained from their default (random or zero) initialisation by the code
in this folder.
