Dataset material
----------------

The label files in samples/ are derived from the COCO 2017 annotations
(CC BY 4.0, © COCO Consortium). No dataset photographs are redistributed:
the five demo images are COCO train2017 Flickr photographs under
individual Creative Commons licenses (three NC, one of them also ND) and are
downloaded by the user via samples/fetch_samples.py; per-image sources
and licenses are listed in samples/ATTRIBUTION.md. Training data (COCO
images and annotation files) is obtained by the user from cocodataset.org
and remains subject to its own terms.
